  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "19.0.0\n* Added support for ZUGFeRD 2.5.2\n* New SpecificationIdentifier property for setting BT-24 independently of the profile (e.g. Peppol BIS Billing 3.0)\n* Added ReceivingAdviceReferencedDocument (BT-15-00)\n* Fixed gross unit price and line-level allowances/charges (BT-147, BT-148) when reading UBL/XRechnung\n* Fixed tax category serialization for line allowances (BT-95) in the ZUGFeRD 2.5 CII writer\n* Fixed missing ApplicableHeaderTradeDelivery element when empty\n* Hardened XML parsing against XXE and oversized-stream attacks",
